ちゃんとパシャパシャ\n カメラマンごっこして遊んでます\n \n とても謎な遊びですが（笑）\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG9VTK6353WPPHVE5M8ZMN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 鏡よ鏡よ、鏡さん\n 世界で一番可愛いのはだーれ？\n \n さりなちゃんだよ😘\n \n そんな茶番が始まって\n しまいそうな写真ですが\n 気を取り直して\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG9WSXCATCS9WH6RQM75JM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n スタート\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG9XVGJ50GYA4GA976VE2W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG9YWJEBKCXTF562JX1R0N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n もーう\n まおちゃん\n ちゃんと可愛いの選んでよねー\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHG9ZWWFPC2MCK6X0ZMJAPW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA0W2NDYHF0HJ1WFQN2V7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA1XFSMV0V4XAVRCEXVW7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA2YS7GZA5XVK4QE256KV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA3Y1K9AW0MQ0DFR73Q47","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA4ZHWXBKZ5YMAZTGXNJZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA606CHQZMJND17WEJ97V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA701DS80W2C8396X1YZW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHGA7YCAPTHNMW9W6KD5WGT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"typ